    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:DEU:9:11",
      "sequence": 5169,
      "chapter_label": "DEU 9",
      "verse_label": "11",
      "locator": {
        "book": "DEU",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "It came to pass at the end of forty days and forty nights that the LORD gave me the two stone tablets, even the tablets of the covenant.",
      "ko": "사십 주야가 지난 후에 여호와께서 내게 돌판 곧 언약의 두 돌판을 주시고",
      "source_text_hash": "dd49d26823d15bee9097f65c3abc5967e446855d0162d3e360df9be4df68de5c",
      "translation_text_hash": "1f80bc60b161f00f1c1d789fa55f13efe1a236abf0dc6226e9245c7d4ebba4dc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "사십 주야가 지난 후에 여호와께서 내게 돌판 곧 언약의 두 돌판을 주시고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1f80bc60b161f00f1c1d789fa55f13efe1a236abf0dc6226e9245c7d4ebba4dc"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:DEU:9:12",
      "sequence": 5170,
      "chapter_label": "DEU 9",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
        "book": "DEU",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD said to me, “Arise, get down quickly from here; for your people whom you have brought out of Egypt have corrupted themselves. They have quickly turned away from the way which I commanded them. They have made a molten image for themselves!”",
      "ko": "내게 이르시되 일어나 여기서 속히 내려가라 네가 애굽에서 인도하여 낸 내 백성이 스스로 부패하여 내가 그들에게 명한 도를 속히 떠나 자기를 위하여 우상을 부어 만들었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "75471e84b096777e5fcbde33e62b88e991ef4feb0da657dd61b8f9dae9dbe1de",
