      ],
      "en": "So I turned and came down from the mountain, and the mountain was burning with fire. The two tablets of the covenant were in my two hands.",
      "ko": "내가 돌이켜 산에서 내려오는데 산에는 불이 붙었고 언약의 두 돌판은 내 손에 있었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "abe51e663548def25e9700f1b7707f9c8f7caaade31f28ffa6e422b668195707",
      "translation_text_hash": "3dfd9dfa582b47ce4b45d5fed616f89b4378e8bc76c0142c488d9919016e5d87",
