        "verse": 19
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 19
        }
      ],
      "en": "For I was afraid of the anger and hot displeasure with which the LORD was angry against you to destroy you. But the LORD listened to me that time also.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 심히 분노하사 너희를 멸하려 하셨으므로 내가 두려워 하였었노라 그러나 여호와께서 그 때에도 내 말을 들으셨고",
      "source_text_hash": "84e297ed7533d457a2f3c254e32521ec123666140448856850998ea04d784b95",
