      "en": "The LORD was angry enough with Aaron to destroy him. I prayed for Aaron also at the same time.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 또 아론에게 진노하사 그를 멸하려 하셨으므로 내가 그 때에도 아론을 위하여 기도하고",
      "source_text_hash": "7c65fdbc55614105e0450bc5d6966ce0d7947f18e949ea900ab52843649e28d0",
      "translation_text_hash": "30284ad625ecedc3457b212d9e49957a4436aa6e5abb6b99cc5ccb6ee499fe69",
