      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "At Taberah, at Massah, and at Kibroth Hattaavah you provoked the LORD to wrath.",
      "ko": "너희가 다베라와 맛사와 기브롯 핫다아와에서도 여호와를 격노케 하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c08b85294fc2fe9872681dab74fc857dbd4843361f1ac202b6a7285cf77c8528",
      "translation_text_hash": "ec6344ffb2e8e0d5f29372563c1fabe36d5fcd04e27933961a3ad8b2110b44e7",
