      ],
      "en": "So I fell down before the LORD the forty days and forty nights that I fell down, because the LORD had said he would destroy you.",
      "ko": "그 때에 여호와께서 너희를 멸하겠다 하셨으므로 내가 여전히 사십 주야를 여호와 앞에 엎드리고",
      "source_text_hash": "61a029b754ff12b74cc78b6762b389d7f9647d0baddbe5ce1136247498e31466",
      "translation_text_hash": "b153ef5a81314f77b24ff4715e589d25b6aa05c76bb9366c67e00d03415c06cb",
