      "en": "Yet they are your people and your inheritance, which you brought out by your great power and by your outstretched arm.”",
      "ko": "그들은 주의 큰 능력과 펴신 팔로 인도하여 내신 주의 백성 곧 주의 기업이로소이다 하였었노라",
      "source_text_hash": "6cdea81c9a1db1f47beae7cb41dfe3350b36596e528c5cc3954dd74e4f297c8f",
      "translation_text_hash": "e181b8f3b45a887af9aef0bcaa01aa12190ea067b12780b0d6fe49002474093b",
